WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:11.720
Hello!

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.600
You know you gotta pay for that right?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:15.900
Hey!

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.100
Come on

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.520
[screaming]

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:21.960
Not okay!

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.080
We got ourselves an x-men fan

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.960
Maybe a quarter of it happens!

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.060
and not like this

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.140
In the real world, people die

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:42.400
Logan!

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.880
I dont wanna talk about it! Logan!

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:44.760
Just stop!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:46.760
Be careful!

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.000
I need the girl

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.100
What girl?

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.340
Go get her!

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.580
[Screaming]

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:07.720
No!

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:08.940
Noooo

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:10.640
NO!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.160
[Screaming]

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.860
[ music "And way down we go" ]

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.780
She's like you

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.500
Very much like you

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.420
I am not whatever it is you think I am

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:34.720
She needs our help

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.460
someone will come along

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.700
someone has come along

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.580
This is what life looks like

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.280
people who love each other

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:51.280
a home

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.780
You should take a moment

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.300
feel it

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.120
you still have time

